  Note: 'Master reference table for rights_audit_session. Referenced by session_id. | Unity Catalog table: media_broadcasting_ecm.rights.rights_audit_session Aligned with EBU CCDM (Tech 3351) Class Conceptual Data Model semantics. Integrates with Rightsline (rights management).'
