  invoice_id varchar [note: 'Foreign key linking to billing.invoice. Business justification: Guild pension/health contributions are billed to production companies as invoice line items. Real business process: remittances appear on production company bills, tracked for guild compliance audits, | Column invoice_id (BIGINT) in billing.pension_health_contribution']
