  late_payment_penalty_amount decimal(18,2) [note: 'Penalty amount assessed by the guild benefit fund for late remittance of the contribution, if applicable. | Column late_payment_penalty_amount (DECIMAL(18,2)) in talent.pension_health_contribution']
