  Note: 'Transactional record of Pension and Health (P&H) contributions remitted to guild benefit funds on behalf of talent — capturing contribution period, guild fund (SAG-AFTRA Health Plan, SAG-Producers Pension Plan, DGA-Producer Pension and Health Plan, WGA Pension Plan), gross compensation base, contribution rate, employer contribution amount, employee contribution amount, remittance date, fund reference number, and reconciliation status. Mandatory for SAG-AFTRA, DGA, and WGA compliance. Feeds SAP S/4HANA AP and HR payroll modules. | Unity Catalog table: media_broadcasting_ecm.talent.pension_health_contribution Talent/residuals entity supporting contract+compensation_structure+guild_affiliation+cba_rate_card+residual_payment flows.'
}

Table talent.talent_clearance {
