  usage_right_id varchar [note: 'Foreign key linking to talent.usage_right. Business justification: talent_clearance records the rights verification process for talent usage. usage_right defines the granted rights with usage_scope, territory, platform, and window dates. Currently clearance has usage | Column usage_right_id (BIGINT) in talent.talent_clearance']
